# The backend image builds from the repo root (it needs the root Directory.Build.props and global.json).
# Allow-list only what it needs.
*
!Directory.Build.props
!global.json
# The analyzer settings, including the exemption for EF's generated migrations. Without it the publish
# inside the image is held to different rules than the build outside it, and fails on generated code.
!.editorconfig
!backend/
backend/**/bin/
backend/**/obj/
backend/tests/
